				<r3d:description language="eng">Data Observatory is the result of a public-private-academic collaboration in Chile that seeks to maximize the benefits that can be obtained from data for science, research, and productive development. This is achieved by creating, managing, and enriching open data platforms that are available to the community to generate public policies and initiatives that have a social impact in areas related to climate change, logistics and transportation, mining, aquaculture, land management, and natural disaster prevention, among others.</r3d:description>
